templates.body:
Dear {{patient_name}},

Thank you for registering with {{clinic_name}}. Your patient portal account has been successfully created.

Registration details:
- Patient reference: {{patient_id}}
- Registration date: {{registration_date}}
- Portal access: {{portal_url}}

Please use the official portal to manage appointments and access available patient services.

For assistance, contact {{contact_details}}.

Regards,
Patient Services Team
{{clinic_name}}

Dear {{patient_name}},

Your appointment with {{clinic_name}} has been confirmed.

Appointment details:
- Reference: {{appointment_reference}}
- Date: {{appointment_date}}
- Time: {{appointment_time}} {{time_zone}}
- Doctor or department: {{doctor_or_department}}
- Location: {{clinic_address}}

Manage your appointment: {{appointment_url}}

Please contact {{contact_details}} if you need assistance.

Regards,
Appointments Team
{{clinic_name}}

Dear {{patient_name}},

This is a reminder about your upcoming appointment at {{clinic_name}}.

Date: {{appointment_date}}
Time: {{appointment_time}} {{time_zone}}
Location: {{clinic_address}}
Appointment reference: {{appointment_reference}}

Please arrive {{arrival_time}} before your scheduled appointment, if requested by the clinic. To reschedule, contact {{contact_details}}.

Regards,
Patient Coordination Team
{{clinic_name}}

Dear {{patient_name}},

Your appointment with {{clinic_name}} has been updated.

Previous appointment: {{previous_date_time}}
New appointment: {{new_date_time}}
Doctor or department: {{doctor_or_department}}
Location: {{clinic_address}}

Please review the updated details and contact {{contact_details}} if you have questions.

Regards,
Appointments Team
{{clinic_name}}

Dear {{patient_name}},

This email confirms the cancellation of your appointment.

Appointment reference: {{appointment_reference}}
Original date: {{appointment_date}}
Department: {{department}}

To schedule a new appointment, visit {{booking_url}} or contact {{contact_details}}.

Regards,
Patient Services Team
{{clinic_name}}

Dear {{patient_name}},

An update regarding your prescription is available.

Prescription reference: {{prescription_id}}
Pharmacy: {{pharmacy_name}}
Collection or delivery status: {{status}}

For collection details or assistance, contact {{pharmacy_contact_details}}. Please follow your healthcare professional’s instructions regarding your medication.

Regards,
Pharmacy Services Team

Dear {{patient_name}},

Your online consultation with {{clinic_name}} has been scheduled.

Date: {{appointment_date}}
Time: {{appointment_time}} {{time_zone}}
Doctor: {{doctor_name}}
Consultation reference: {{appointment_id}}

Join your consultation using the secure link: {{telehealth_url}}

Please check your internet connection and device before the appointment.

Regards,
Telehealth Support Team
{{clinic_name}}

Dear {{patient_name}},

Thank you. We have successfully received your payment.

Payment details:
- Invoice number: {{invoice_number}}
- Amount paid: {{amount}}
- Payment date: {{payment_date}}
- Payment reference: {{transaction_id}}
- Status: {{payment_status}}

View your receipt securely: {{receipt_url}}

For billing enquiries, contact {{billing_contact_details}}.

Regards,
Billing Department
{{clinic_name}}

Dear {{patient_name}},

Please note that {{clinic_name}} will have revised operating hours due to {{reason}}.

Date: {{date}}
Revised hours: {{operating_hours}}
Regular operations resume: {{resume_date}}

For appointment-related assistance, contact {{contact_details}}. For urgent medical emergencies, contact your local emergency services.

Regards,
Administration Team
{{clinic_name}}
